30px 0px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17575451039141\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17575451039141_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><h1 style=\"margin:0; font-size:22px; line-height:125%; text-align:center; font-weight:normal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #162331\"></span></h1></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><!--<![endif]-->\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 25px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17915279424651\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17915279424651_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><p style=\"line-height:150%; font-size:22px; text-align:center; font-weight:normal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\">Read all about it (without reading <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><em>all</em></span> of it).</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; font-size:22px; text-align:center; font-weight:normal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Green Street News</span> is now in the MCP Server.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; font-size:11px\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Here's the scoop:</span> </span><span style=\"color: #162331;\">The same trusted, timely, and relevant Green Street News clients rely on today, is now part of the MCP Server alongside data and research intelligence. Ask a question in plain English and see how <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">news brings context to every prompt</span>&nbsp;— with a synthesized answer and&nbsp;link back to the full article.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"color: #162331; font-size: 14px;\">Whether your question draws on Research, Company Data, Market Data, Forecasts, or Sales Comps, Green Street News adds the developments, transactions,&nbsp;and market activity behind the numbers. Go from a headline to the data, or from a data point to the story, all without leaving your AI assistant.</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section_1790864803576\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#FBFBFA; padding-bottom:20px\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n    \n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n      <table align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n      <tr style=\"background-color:#FBFBFA;\">\n    <![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:600px;padding-bottom:20px;\">\n<![endif]-->\n<!--[if gte mso 9]>\n  <table ro